{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Types of Enterprise Architecture"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about enterprise architecture."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Interpret the technical design report, to determine the work plan during the phase of building the software, based on regulation ad protocols established by the company.  Design the architecture design using the appropriate tools and types according to the software requirements."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Recognizes simple ideas on persisting storage, web applications, and the functional phase of an IT project."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Superlatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">superlatives</span> to compare one object with a group of objects."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">superlatives</span> with adjectives or adverbs. In order to make a sentence using a <span class=\"strong\">superlative</span>, you can use the following structure: <br/><br/>  <div class=\"center_text\">Subject + Verb + <span class=\"strong\">the</span> + <span class=\"strong\">Adjective in Superlative Form</span> + Complement</div><br/><br/>    Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">She develops <span class=\"strong\">the best</span> accounting software in the industry. </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">She is <span class=\"strong\">the most talented</span> software coder I've ever met. </span><br/><br/>  Take a look at some rules that we need to follow in order to use adjectives in their <span class=\"strong\">superlative</span> form:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Rule</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you have 1-syllable adjectives, you add <span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u2013est</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fast = The fast <span class=\\\"strong\\\">est</span><br/> Smart = The smart<span class=\\\"strong\\\">est</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you have a consonant-vowel-consonant combination, you need to double the last consonant.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Big = The big <span class=\\\"strong\\\">gest</span><br/> Thin = The Thin <span class=\\\"strong\\\">nest</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If the adjective ends in a consonant + y, you eliminate the letter y and add <span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u2013est</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Funny = The funn <span class=\\\"strong\\\">iest</span><br/> Tiny = The tin <span class=\\\"strong\\\">iest</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If it is a 2+ syllable adjective, you add <span class=\\\"strong\\\">the most</span> before the adjective.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expensive = <span class=\\\"strong\\\">The most</span> expensive<br/> Recognized = <span class=\\\"strong\\\">The most</span> recognized\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exceptions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Good = the Best<br/> Bad = The worst<br/> Far = The farthest / the furthest\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would say that business architecture is the most suitable of all of them to help a company meet its goals."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Application architecture is the most interactive in terms of design. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Technical architecture is the one that requires the most support. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Types of Enterprise Architecture"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Enterprise architecture is fundamental to make a company or business work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The types of enterprise architecture are Business Architecture, Application Architecture, Information Architecture, and Information Technology Architecture. All of them are connected and make the enterprise architecture work properly. Let's take a look at their characteristics:"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hermit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who lives isolated from the world"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Every time I say I'm a software architect people imagine I'm some kind of hermit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "have the slightest clue "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to know nothing about a topic "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(idiom)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: To be a software architect, you don't really need to have the slightest clue about coding or programming."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brief  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "short"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am going to give you a brief explanation of enterprise architecture.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sort out "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to organize something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have business architecture, which is the most important one, as it sorts out and defines the governance and strategies of any business."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "logical "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not physical"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have Information architecture where we find all the logical and physical data a company works with."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le01ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research a little further about Enterprise Architecture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In your opinion, what's the best type of architecture and why?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "What's the most practical type of architecture and why?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe 3 of  the most important functions of the architectural pattern."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In your words, what do you understand about Software Architecture?"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I explain the concept of  Enterprise Architecture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe the best type of architecture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I classify several types of architecture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify the most important functions of architectural pattern."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I summarize the Software Architecture concept."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can list the different types of enterprise architecture."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe four types of enterprise architecture."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make comparisons between the different types of enterprise architecture."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What type of software do companies usually use?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What kind of technology would you like to have in your own company? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Architectures from the Viewpoint of an Enterprise"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Types of Enterprise Architecture"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name